    "sections": {
        "description": "Coffee Espresso Studio theme is a thoughtfully crafted theme designed for cafés, coffee shops, roasteries, and small food businesses that want a clean and structured online presence. Built with a focus on usability, it offers a flexible layout that supports menu display, product showcasing, and storytelling through visuals. The theme integrates smoothly with Gutenberg, making content editing simple and efficient. It includes sections for featured drinks, pricing tables, gallery layouts, and customer highlights, helping businesses present their brand clearly. With optimized performance and lightweight coding, the Coffee Espresso Studio theme ensures faster loading and better browsing experience. Key features include responsive layout, SEO-friendly structure, translation readiness, blog support, and easy customization. This theme is suitable for espresso bars, bakery websites, coffee portfolios, and modern café businesses looking for a refined digital presence."
    },
